@fact vey.illusion
# en: Teaches Illusion & Glamour and grades on whether you fooled her.
text [c1fb18] = 教幻术与魅影，按你骗没骗过她来打分。

@fact vey.tests
# en: She tests students in corridors, unannounced, with tea that isn't there. She keeps score.
text [60f4e6] = 她会在走廊里突击考学生，用并不存在的茶。她一直在记分。
# en: Expect a question in a corridor.
hint [dfcbaf] = 当心在走廊里被提问。

@fact vey.revue
# en: She produces the faculty revue every year, and has never once let Professor Thorne refuse a part.
text [d5edf4] = 她每年都负责排演教职员汇演，从没让索恩教授推掉过一个角色。
# en: Ask about the faculty revue.
hint [c5140f] = 问问教职工的年度演出。

@fact vey.mirror
# en: She doesn't use the mirror charm in public. Once, her reflection didn't come back for a week.
text [950435] = 她从不在人前用镜像咒。有一次，她的倒影整整一周没回来。
# en: Ask why she never uses the mirror charm.
hint [b56b0d] = 问问她为什么从不用镜像咒。

@fact vey.smell
# en: She teaches that sight is easy to fool; smell is where liars are caught.
text [e9a79d] = 她教导说，骗过眼睛很容易；骗子是在气味上露馅的。
# en: Bake something false in her class.
hint [d8bd09] = 在她课上烤点假东西。

@fact vey.own_face
# en: She has every student glamour their own face first: a glamour you can't hold on yourself, she says, won't hold on anyone.
text [fb13dd] = 她让每个学生先给自己的脸施幻术：她说，自己身上都撑不住的幻术，放到谁身上也撑不住。
# en: Change one small thing about yourself, in her class.
hint [83587e] = 在她课上，改变自己身上的一个小地方。
